
LiveStage installer (Alpine Linux)

  livestage-installer                 the installer (it runs on Alt+F1 too)
  livestage-installer --list          the disks, and which can take LiveStage
  livestage-installer --disk /dev/sdX --yes [--setup-conf FILE]
                                      install with no questions
  blkid, sfdisk -l, efibootmgr        what the disks and the firmware hold

  The installer's medium (the ISO) is mounted at /media/medium; the image it
  installs is /media/medium/livestage/livestage.img.zst. Changes to this
  system are kept in memory only.

